  <data>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" width="840" height="24">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122,138,125,1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false">
        <p>02 · RESEARCH QUESTION · 研究问题与定位</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" width="840" height="52">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25">
        <p>研究问题：重分句鲁棒性，能否被可验证地评估</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="60" startY="124" endX="900" endY="124">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="152" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>不是再找一个攻击方法</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="194" width="400" height="200">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">初步假设</span>：句级语义水印普遍依赖 unitization（分割单元化），重分句是系统性的脆弱面。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">审计结果</span>：AliMark 已把 split/merge 与重构对齐列为核心问题；SwordStamp 已覆盖 rewording / reordering / resegmentation 与子句检测。<span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">继续做普通重分句实验没有增量，广义依赖 No-Go。</span></p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="152" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">
        <p>收窄为可验证的证书问题</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="194" width="400" height="200">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">保留的切口</span>：固定词序、固定单位数与边界移动预算 k，对<span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">全部合法重分句</span>求检测统计量的最坏值，并给出可验证的鲁棒性证书。</p>
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">定位</span>：与 SWAN 主证据流独立；研究同一个句级分割接口，为"鲁棒性可被精确评估"提供方法学证据。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <line startX="60" startY="470" endX="900" endY="470">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="482" width="840" height="44">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p><span bold="true" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)">一句话定位</span>：我们不是报告"我们又攻破了哪个水印"，而是问——<span bold="true" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)">"重分句威胁"能不能被精确、可验证、可复现地评估</span>，并在两个真实系统上检验评估本身是否成立。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="60" startY="506" endX="900" endY="506">
      <border color="rgba(42,45,48,0.2)" width="1"/>
    </line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="514" width="840" height="20">
      <content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122,138,125,1)">
        <p>来源：叙事.md Plan Q；系统检索 2026-09-22</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>先讲清楚研究问题。我们最初想问句级语义水印是否普遍依赖分割单元化。</p>
      <p>审计发现 AliMark 和 SwordStamp 已经把拆分合并、重分句、子句检测都做过了，普通实验没有增量，广义假设裁为 No-Go。</p>
      <p>于是问题收窄成：给定词序、单位数和移动预算，能否对所有合法重分句求最坏检测分数，并给出可验证证书。</p>
      <p>这决定了整条证据流不是"找攻击"，而是"评估方法学"。</p>
    </content>
  </note>
